@startuml
title Activity 10 - Manager Approves or Rejects Purchase Order

|Manager|
start
:Open PO Approval queue;
|Frontend|
:GET pending manager POs;
|Backend|
:Verify Manager role;
if (Manager authorized?) then (yes)
  :Return PO and request details;
  |Manager|
  :Review supplier, totals, terms and delivery date;
  :Choose Approve or Reject;
  if (Reject?) then (yes)
    :Enter rejection reason;
    |Backend|
    :Set PO status = REJECTED;
    :Release request reservation;
    :Notify requester and executive;
    stop
  else (Approve)
    |Backend|
    :Set PO status = APPROVED;
    :Create supplier acknowledgement task;
    :Notify requester;
    :Notify supplier in-app and email;
    |Manager|
    :See approval confirmation;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Return 403;
  |Frontend|
  :Hide queue and redirect;
  stop
endif
@enduml
